<div class="section" id="env">
  <h2>🔑 Variáveis de Ambiente — .env</h2>
  
  <div class="warning">
    <strong>⚠️ IMPORTANTE:</strong> Nunca commite o arquivo <code>.env</code> no Git! Adicione ao <code>.gitignore</code>.
  </div>
  
  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header">
      <span class="code-title">.env.example</span>
      <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this, 'env-code')">Copiar</button>
    </div>
    <pre id="env-code"><code># Google OAuth2 Credentials
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=seu-client-id-aqui.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=seu-client-secret-aqui
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/auth/google/callback

# Server
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development
SESSION_SECRET=gmail-cleaner-secret-change-this-in-production

# IMPORTANTE: Nunca commite o arquivo .env no Git!
# Adicione ao .gitignore</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h3>Criar arquivo .gitignore</h3>
  
  <div class="code-block">
    <div class="code-header">
      <span class="code-title">.gitignore</span>
      <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this, 'gitignore-code')">Copiar</button>
    </div>
    <pre id="gitignore-code"><code>node_modules/
.env
.DS_Store
*.log</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>

